{"parentUuid":"6392bba8-5f20-4227-bd9d-2d013980eda9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01JwBxx8HLcMhtHi8Bw4GNzC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WypMW4TGS3wBYv7RhnBiam","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/peytonmontei/.claude/projects/-Users-peytonmontei-Documents-entire-devenv-entireio-cli/memory/feedback_verify_branch_matches_pr.md","content":"---\nname: verify-branch-matches-pr-before-editing\ndescription: Before editing files for a PR in this repo, verify the current branch matches the PR's headRefName — the workspace has 60+ worktrees and the cwd is often on a different branch than expected\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nBefore editing any file for a specific PR in this repo, run `git branch --show-current` (or `git -C <path> branch --show-current` for a non-cwd worktree) and verify it matches the PR's `headRefName` from `gh pr view <N> --json headRefName`. If not, find or create a worktree on the correct branch *before* editing.\n\n**Why:** Peyton's `entireio/cli` workspace has 60+ active git worktrees across many feature branches (see `git worktree list`), and the conversation cwd is frequently a worktree on a branch unrelated to the PR being discussed. On 2026-05-11 I edited `manifest.go` and `manifest_test.go` for PR 1185 from `.worktrees/review-fix-2/.worktrees/review-fix-local` (which is on `feat/review-detail-viewport`, NOT PR 1185's `feat/review-manifest-diagnostic`). The edits applied to a file that happened to share content with PR 1185 by coincidence (pre-existing uncommitted state), tests passed, and I almost committed to the wrong branch. Caught only when `git diff --stat` showed unrelated TUI changes alongside my edits.\n\n**How to apply:**\n\n1. After `gh pr view <N>`, immediately note the `headRefName`.\n2. Run `git branch --show-current`. If it doesn't match, do NOT edit yet.\n3. Use `git worktree list` to find an existing worktree on the PR branch. If one exists, operate there via absolute paths or `git -C`.\n4. If none exists, `git worktree add /tmp/cli-pr<N>-fix <branch>`, do work there, push, then `git worktree remove`.\n5. Note: `git worktree list` output can be stale relative to in-flight branch switches — re-run `git -C <path> status` to confirm the current branch of any specific worktree before relying on it.\n\nRelated: [[feedback_few_commits_per_pr]] (commits should land on the PR's branch, obviously).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2222,"cache_read_input_tokens":147494,"output_tokens":2279,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2222,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2279,"cache_read_input_tokens":147494,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2222,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2222},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cax1uD3EFpbKy51nyxMvj","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b9f1609-cfc2-4514-9ad0-d286dfb94417","timestamp":"2026-05-12T04:08:02.930Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/review-fix-2/.worktrees/review-fix-local","sessionId":"a15672a4-e3dc-456e-b0fd-c521cad18358","version":"2.1.139","gitBranch":"feat/review-detail-viewport"}
