luded.\n- Viewport seeded with non-zero defaults (`tui_model.go:100-107`) so immediate Ctrl+O before a WindowSizeMsg doesn't divide by zero or render an empty frame — pinned by `TestTUIModel_InitializesDetailViewport`.\n- `splitBodyToHeight` (`tui_detail.go:118-135`) handles empty body and short content gracefully — pads with spaces, never panics on zero-line input.</result>\n<usage><total_tokens>84465</total_tokens><tool_uses>28</tool_uses><duration_ms>307998</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
